Elizabeth,

The bimodal distributions often indicate a problem with parameter identification. If you are fixing latent variances to 1 for identification, make sure you use the argument std.lv <http://std.lv>=TRUE when you estimate the model. Otherwise, we might be able to help more if you send the code for your model.

Also, blavaan will not automatically allow for Dirichlet priors, but I'm not sure that you would need them here.

Ed

